  "notes": "Columbia documents a 20 m dome diameter and a 37 m height. The Istanbul heritage directorate describes the cut stone windowed tympana and the late single minaret. The exact cleared 1912 photo shows alternating arch bands and column recesses, and Gurlitt’s section shows dome, drum and aperture proportions."
